add('Functional Equivalence Mapping (FEM) distinguishes evidence of equivalent reporter activity within a specified tolerance from evidence of meaningful difference and insufficient precision. The detailed definition is given in Section 8.2. The empirical results reported here are from the companion manuscript, not a new genomic reanalysis.')
